# Extended-features + IW runtime cost (4 permutations)

Image: 512×512 (262144 pixels), iters per config: 50
Synthetic deterministic gradient + perturbation

| Config | n_features | min ms | median ms | mean ms | × vs standard |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Standard      (228 features) | 228 | 6.82 | 7.71 | 7.86 | 1.00× |
| Extended only (300 features = +masked) | 300 | 7.84 | 8.65 | 9.01 | 1.15× |
| IW only       (300 features = +IW) | 300 | 7.86 | 8.70 | 9.00 | 1.15× |
| Extended + IW (372 features = +masked +IW) | 372 | 7.86 | 8.77 | 9.12 | 1.16× |

_All times are wall-clock per `compute_zensim_with_config` call, single (ref, dist) pair, parallel=true (rayon)._
